      "customfield_10001" : "1_*:*_1_*:*_63493651372_*|*_5_*:*_1_*:*_0",
      "customfield_10012" : "0|i0047j:",
      "customfield_10300" : "{}",
      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "#\t\t\t\tgit commit 2b15e06ee6935eb4710e651b8c3f59a9d2b64c3c",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "#\t\t\t\tMoved defines from Stroika-Config.h to  commandline (for UNIX ONLY SO FAR)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "PROS:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "simpler to have all defines done in one place, and not have some in Stroika-Config.h and some on commandline",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "bulletList"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "CONS:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "when people LINKING against Stroika, slightly easier to screw up and not have consistent define  (though this is detectable through CompileTimeFlagChecker_HEADER",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "defines now globally set - so compiling compoents that have nothing todo with stroika also see these defines (minor and avoidable by adding a config var ALL_STROIKA_SPECIFIC__CPP_DEFINES and using makefile filter-out).",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "bulletList"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "So could easily go either way.  For now - go with makefile approach (switched to for unix).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "And if any need to filter out - add the additional config variables to CONFIGRUATION.xml file (etc).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
      },
